--   965 Tampere University Tuition Fee Scholarships and Early Bird Offer (rel 10)
--   966 Pekka Mattila Excellence Scholarship, Aalto School of Business  (rel 10)
-- sources 3100 (LUT discounts page) / 3101 (Tampere fees & scholarships page);
-- links 964->3100, 965->3101, 966->2476 (existing Aalto scholarships source);
-- university_scholarships 696 (Aalto university 103). 964/965 keep university_id NULL:
